event: thinking
data: {"id": "19381da8656e4a56-thinking-parallel_evidence-1156", "run_id": "19381da8656e4a56", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 证据采集结果与分析\n\n#### 1. 核心事实 (Facts)\n*   **实体身份**: `aiops-case-v14/workload` (UID: `88142b75-b82f-4017-9a97-aff51ae275a8`)，调度在节点 `node2` 上。\n*   **当前状态**: `Pending`，等待原因为 `ContainerCreating`。\n*   **异常事件**: `FailedCreatePodSandBox` (9m3s 前)。\n*   **事件详情**: \n    `failed to setup network for sandbox ... plugin type=\"multus\" ... failed to find plugin \"aiops-unavailable\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/bin]`\n*   **资源配置 (YAML)**:\n    *   使用了 Multus CNI 附加网络：`k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: secondary-net`。\n  ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789374071286, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "19381da8656e4a56-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "19381da8656e4a56", "seq": 1157, "ts_ms": 1789374079705, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 36.508, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v14", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/19381da8656e4a56-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "2abc32512ddf0ad315bfc4d6f72a0f61237bd4ac967c8e115d0db2632c67b94d", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "5fd01340eb2e97201edfb835047988058208084cb5bfbca0fef46ce776adee6e"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "19381da8656e4a56-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "19381da8656e4a56", "seq": 1158, "ts_ms": 1789374079706, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "19381da8656e4a56-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "19381da8656e4a56", "seq": 1159, "ts_ms": 1789374086190, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 6.484, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1333, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v14/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v14/workload 处于 ContainerCreating 状态，Sandbox 创建失败 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: failed to setup network for sandbox \"a2dd4c...\": plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed... error adding container to network \"secondary-net\": failed to find plugin \"aiops-unavailable\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/bin] | 定位失败机制：Multus 插件 `aiops-unavailable` 缺失导致网络配置阻塞 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-v14/workload` 状态 `ContainerCreating` | 呈现启动停滞现象 |\n| 3 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 确认 Pod 持续处于创建等待状态 |\n\n证据表明，Pod 因缺少指定的 CNI 插件二进制文件而无法完成网络初始化，导致始终卡在 ContainerCreating 阶段。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n节点 node2 缺少 CNI 插件 'aiops-unavailable' 二进制文件 → Multus 尝试创建网络沙箱时因找不到插件报错 → Pod 沙箱创建失败，状态停留在 ContainerCreating → 容器无法启动 (waiting_reason: ContainerCreating)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是节点 `node2` 缺失 `aiops-unavailable` CNI 插件二进制文件。由于 Pod `aiops-case-v14/workload` 配置了二级网络 `secondary-net`，调度至该节点后，Multus 插件在 `/opt/cni/bin` 目录下找不到 `aiops-unavailable` 二进制文件，导致网络沙箱创建失败（证据 1），进而使 Pod 无法脱离 `ContainerCreating` 状态（证据 2, 3）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v14/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v14/workload 处于 ContainerCreating 状态，Sandbox 创建失败 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: failed to setup network for sandbox \"a2dd4c...\": plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed... error adding container to network \"secondary-net\": failed to find plugin \"aiops-unavailable\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/bin] | 定位失败机制：Multus 插件 `aiops-unavailable` 缺失导致网络配置阻塞 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-v14/workload` 状态 `ContainerCreating` | 呈现启动停滞现象 |\n| 3 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 确认 Pod 持续处于创建等待状态 |\n\n证据表明，Pod 因缺少指定的 CNI 插件二进制文件而无法完成网络初始化，导致始终卡在 ContainerCreating 阶段。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n节点 node2 缺少 CNI 插件 'aiops-unavailable' 二进制文件 → Multus 尝试创建网络沙箱时因找不到插件报错 → Pod 沙箱创建失败，状态停留在 ContainerCreating → 容器无法启动 (waiting_reason: ContainerCreating)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是节点 `node2` 缺失 `aiops-unavailable` CNI 插件二进制文件。由于 Pod `aiops-case-v14/workload` 配置了二级网络 `secondary-net`，调度至该节点后，Multus 插件在 `/opt/cni/bin` 目录下找不到 `aiops-unavailable` 二进制文件，导致网络沙箱创建失败（证据 1），进而使 Pod 无法脱离 `ContainerCreating` 状态（证据 2, 3）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

